* Weighted PB constraint test - SAT
* 3*x1 + 2*x2 + x3 + x4 >= 4
* This requires either:
*   - x1=T (contributes 3), needs 1 more from x2,x3,x4
*   - x1=F, x2=T (contributes 2), needs 2 more from x3,x4
*   - x1=F, x2=F, x3=T, x4=T (contributes 2) - not enough!
* #variable= 4 #constraint= 1
+3 x1 +2 x2 +1 x3 +1 x4 >= 4 ;
